<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράφημι</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραίφημι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρφημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speak
				gently to, advise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρὶ δ᾽ ἐγὼ παράφημι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.577
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, <i>persuade, appease</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνηστῆρας μαλακοῖς ἐπέεσσι παρφάσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.287
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιν᾽ ἄλλον παρφάμενος ἐπέεσσιν
					ἀποτρέψεις πολέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.249
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.189
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλακοῖσι παραιφάμενοι ἐπέεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> freq. with
			collat. notion of deceit, <i>speak deceitfully</i> or
				<i>insincerely</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρφάμεν ὅρκον,
				λόγον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				9.43
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλά μιν παρφαμένα</span>
			<i>beguiling</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.32
			</span></i>.</div>
